# Tesla Fleet API Proxy (Simplified)
# ==================================
# This Edge Function uses Client ID + Refresh Token to get vehicle data.
# No OAuth redirects needed.
#
# To deploy:
#   supabase secrets set TESLA_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
#   supabase secrets set APP_URL=http://localhost:5173
#   supabase functions deploy tesla-proxy --no-verify-jwt